update public.article_cache set translation = '{"texts": ["The age at which Korean young people get married keeps getting later. According to 2025 Statistics Korea data, the average age at first marriage was found to be 33.7 for men and 31.3 for women.", "This is 2.1 years later for men and 2.3 years later for women compared to ten years ago. Especially in Seoul and the metropolitan area, the trend of marrying later has grown stronger.", "High housing prices and difficulty finding jobs are cited as reasons marriage is being delayed. The analysis is that the younger generation is putting off marriage because of financial burdens.", "Experts warned that if this phenomenon continues, the low-birthrate problem could become more serious. The government said it needs to expand housing support for newlyweds and job-creation policies.", "Meanwhile, \"solo culture\" is also spreading among the younger generation. As young people who enjoy living alone increase, thoughts about marriage have also changed greatly."], "sentences": [{"text": "한국 청년들이 결혼하는 나이가 계속 늦어지고 있어요.", "translation": "The age at which Korean young people get married keeps getting later.", "vocab": [{"ko": "청년", "en": "young person, youth", "note": ""}, {"ko": "결혼하다", "en": "to get married", "note": ""}, {"ko": "늦어지다", "en": "to become later, be delayed", "note": "늦다 + 아/어지다"}], "analysis": [{"type": "grammar", "label": "~고 있다 (continuous)", "exp": "progressive. 늦어지다 → 늦어지고 있다 = \"is getting later\".", "example_in_sentence": "늦어지고 있어요"}, {"type": "grammar", "label": "~아/어지다 (passive / become)", "exp": "change-of-state. 늦다 → 늦어지다 = \"to become late / be delayed\".", "example_in_sentence": "늦어지고"}]}, {"text": "2025년 통계청 자료에 따르면, 평균 초혼 연령(처음 결혼하는 나이)이 남성 33.7세, 여성 31.3세로 나타났습니다.", "translation": "According to 2025 Statistics Korea data, the average age at first marriage was found to be 33.7 for men and 31.3 for women.", "vocab": [{"ko": "통계청", "en": "Statistics Korea", "note": ""}, {"ko": "평균", "en": "average", 